     <td><para unique="1261211">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261213">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261215">SSE</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261217">Compare packed single precision floating-point values in xmm2/m128 and xmm1 using bits 2:0 of imm8 as a comparison predicate.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1261219">VEX.128.0F.WIG C2 /r ib</para>
