  <para unique="1261717">Invalid if SNaN operand and invalid if QNaN and predicate as listed in <link unique="1261716" linkend="&lt;c&gt;CMPPD-Compare-Packed-Double-Precision-Floating-Point-Values.fm#15627: 06_Table: Table 5-1. Comparison Predicate for CMPPD and CMPPS Instructions (Contd.)" xrefstyle="Table Number">Table&#160;3&#8209;8</link>, Denormal.</para>
  </subsection>
